silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_01_gate_discipline_sections_01_source_witness_ingestion_concrete_anchor_7#mittensmeasurementshapegate silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensMeasurementShapeGate is The SHACL shape constraint node that any measurement-leg input must satisfy: required fields are cited_source, value, date, observer; a failed input is rejected before publication. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'ShapeGate', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
